      "image": "cabinet/cabinet.jpg",
      "alt": "The bright ground floor of the doctor's house, a body-and-fitness room with a gym floor on the left and a little indoor pool on the right, painted in ink and gouache: a man in a green tracksuit waves a giant yellow foam hand, a girl stretches her leg on a bench beside an open jar of apricot jam and a curious bee, a sailor rolls his shoulders with a parrot perched on one, a dad lies on a mat while a toy train chugs across his chest, a pelican with a flower puffs out its throat pouch, a giant apple core stretches like a gymnast, a physio gasps at the apple pie by her bare foot, a strongman curls a brass kettlebell, a gnome lifeguard wags his finger from a tall chair, a baker carries a lump of dough on his back, a scruffy dog hugs a heart-shaped pool ring, a plump man floats belly-up over a bubbling jet, a swimmer puffs out her cheeks beside a round soufflé on the poolside, a gnu bends down on its front knees to drink at the pool edge, and a giant chess pawn in goggles raises a tiny fist. Six coloured doors lead off: blue, yellow and red on the ground floor, green, purple and white up the stairs on the balcony; the open glass front door on the far left leads out to the map.",
